 "strings": [
  "",
  "There are heroes,",
  "and there are those who are not.",
  "And there are those who",
  "fell short of being heroes.",
  "The number of people mobilized",
  "in the One Year War, fought across",
  "all of Earth, and space as well,",
  "far exceeded ten million.",
  "Here, for a while, let us",
  "turn from Amuro and his friends",
  "to ordinary officers and men.",
  "The stage is, yes, Southeast Asia.",
  "War is a thing beyond",
  "redemption, but",
  "even so, some fought desperately,",
  "and there were such people here.",
  "In the Earth Federation's army,",
  "most officers were ensigns.",
  "In combat branches, outside",
  "technical posts, it is this rank",
  "that commands a platoon.",
  "A platoon numbers roughly",
  "ten people,",
  "or, for mobile suits, three to four.",
  "The Federation first made platoons",
  "of three units, later four.",
  "Zeon's forces, by contrast,",
  "used four units per platoon.",
  "These figures were worked out",
  "backward from the transport room",
  "of the Musai, Salamis K and such,",
  "but the ground forces",
  "widely used this organization too.",
  "Production of the Zaku series",
  "over the One Year War is said",
  "to have been 3,000 units.",
  "Divided by four, 750 platoons",
  "would have existed.",
  "In reality, around half likely went",
  "to replacing combat losses,",
  "but even allowing for that,",
  "nearly 400 platoons existed,",
  "which means there were 400",
  "ensigns.",
  "The Zaku's successors, the Dom",
  "and the Gelgoog, are thought",
  "to have been fewer,",
  "and Zeon's platoon count over the",
  "One Year War is put at about 800.",
  "The Federation's forces were",
  "30 times the size of Zeon's,",
  "but slow to form mobile suit units;",
  "those had to wait until",
  "the latter half of the war.",
  "In the end, the number",
  "of these platoons reached about",
  "three times Zeon's.",
  "From fewer units to a threefold",
  "edge in the final few months:",
  "that shows how superior",
  "the Federation's production was.",
  "What was formed from this:",
  "2,400 platoons.",
  "That works out to 2,400",
  "platoon leaders in command",
  "of mobile suit platoons.",
  "As for the Federation's",
  "ground forces, most of them",
  "transferred from tank units,",
  "but that alone did not",
  "neatly fill the numbers needed,",
  "and in fact a good many",
  "misfits and men new to the ground",
  "were made platoon leaders",
  "and sent into combat.",
  "In Zeon's case,",
  "partly due to its small size,",
  "even when soldiers",
  "ran short in absolute numbers,",
  "it never lacked commanders.",
  "And so, Southeast Asia.",
  "The time: the war's outcome",
  "was still unclear.",
  "There is a youth, Shiro Amada.",
  "He was hot-blooded and",
  "a capable commander, but as an",
  "Earth Federation ground forces",
  "mobile suit platoon leader,",
  "he was clearly unsuited.",
  "First of all,",
  "he had never set foot on Earth.",
  "Someone who might not even",
  "be able to fight on the ground--",
  "that is who the Federation posted.",
  "Even such a man got a platoon.",
  "That was the harsh reality of war,",
  "and for the soldiers,",
  "getting a platoon leader was",
  "a draw of mostly losing tickets,",
  "a thrill ride",
  "with their lives on the line.",
  "The Case of Michel",
  "The Case of Sanders",
  "Michel Ninorich.",
  "He was 18.",
  "Nominally, he was a corporal,",
  "but only because of a regulation",
  "that, when hiring specialists,",
  "gave them a higher rank",
  "as preferential treatment;",
  "the man himself had no aptitude",
  "for corporal at all.",
  "It would be odd to expect any.",
  "He was only 18, after all.",
  "Not everyone is a Bright",
  "or an Amuro.",
  "His special skill",
  "was maintaining passive",
  "sonar equipment.",
  "He was probably once a graduate",
  "of a communicator-tuning school,",
  "a skill much in demand in space.",
  "And he drew a losing ticket.",
  "The platoon leader he drew",
  "was named Shiro Amada:",
  "hot-blooded, prone to charging,",
  "far from a veteran,",
  "and commissioned from civilian life.",
  "His one good point",
  "was being hopelessly soft--",
  "and that was all.",
  "For a while, he would",
  "keep sending complaints",
  "to his girlfriend.",
  "Terry Sanders Jr.",
  "A sergeant.",
  "A sergeant at 29,",
  "he likely rose up from the ranks.",
  "He presumably became a pilot",
  "because he drew the short straw.",
  "Changing branches, with so much",
  "new to learn,",
  "is, for sergeants and other",
  "enlisted leaders, a loss of sleep",
  "they would rather avoid",
  "if they possibly could.",
  "Also, units usually kept their",
  "favorites at home,",
  "so though capable,",
  "he was presumably disliked.",
  "That Sanders",
  "drew the winning ticket.",
  "Hot-blooded, full of comradeship,",
  "brave,",
  "and above all, lucky.",
  "So unlucky that he was even",
  "called a Grim Reaper, this man",
  "believed that following this leader",
  "would change his luck.",
  "The young man Shiro",
  "was abruptly given command",
  "of a Gundam Ground Type platoon.",
  "This was no great honor;",
  "quite the reverse.",
  "The Gundam Ground Type was",
  "ground-test hardware for Amuro's",
  "Gundam, the concept prototype,",
  "which after testing was over",
  "had been modified to conform",
  "to the mass-produced GM.",
  "For mass production, the GM had",
  "seen this and that downgraded,",
  "from parts precision to materials;",
  "this machine did outperform it,",
  "but alas, spare parts were scarce,",
  "and room for improvement was not",
  "slim but nil, so",
  "on a man named Shiro",
  "they dumped it.",
  "In fact,",
  "the last leader of Shiro's platoon",
  "was gone, in a manner one could",
  "fairly call running away.",
  "A unit stuck with problem machines.",
  "That was the fair verdict on",
  "the 08th MS Team Shiro led.",
  "Shiro, though stuck with them,",
  "had, through sheer drive and zeal,",
  "solved the problems to a degree.",
  "The man knew machines very well.",
  "And this platoon",
  "had many former engineers.",
  "Sanders, Michel",
  "and Shiro himself--these three",
  "bypassed the depot for parts,",
  "built or fixed them themselves,",
  "somehow raised its readiness,",
  "and got it all the way to the front.",
  "And that",
  "was the start of everything.",
  "Platoon Camp",
  "Michel",
  "\"What a smell.",
  " All this green...\"",
  "Shiro",
  "\"Earth's hard on you.\"",
  "Sanders",
  "\"You'll get used to it soon.\"",
  "Eledore",
  "\"It ain't like a colony",
  " with the air-con always on.\"",
  "Karen",
  "\"We're already in enemy territory.\"",
  "\"In response to",
  " the enemy's unexplained",
  " air activity, we...\"",
  "\"Reconnaissance first!\"",
  "\"That's exactly right, sir!\"",
  "\"Now, before we",
  " move out,",
  " the commander will address you.\"",
  "\"...Right.\"",
  "\"It's a shame that I don't",
  " yet know everything",
  " about all of you, but...\"",
  "\"I'll say just this one thing.\"",
  "\"Do not die, no matter what!\"",
  "\"I'll do my utmost too",
  " not to get anyone killed.\"",
  "\"In combat,",
  " however heroically you act,",
  " it means nothing if you're dead.\"",
  "\"As your leader, I want this team",
  " back alive, no one missing...\"",
  "\"...sharing the joy of victory.",
  " That is my earnest wish.\"",
  "\"That is all!\"",
  "\"08th MS Team, move out!\"",
  "\"Nobody wants to die,",
  " Mister Team Leader.\"",
  "\"Still, he's right.\"",
  "\"Hah! This is war, you know.\"",
  "\"Big talk, honestly.",
  " ...Well, for now,",
  " let's see what he can do.\"",
  "\"I hope they make it.",
  " All of them...\""
 ]
